      "Camp I claims $\\mathbb{E}[Y \\mid X_i] = G_{O,i} + \\mathbb{E}[c G_{P,i} \\mid X_i] = G_{O,i} + 0.5 c G_{O,i} = (1 + 0.5 c) G_{O,i}$.",
